## 7. The training script — `src/training/vqa_20260529.py`

Status: written, lint/format clean (`py_compile`, ruff, black all pass). **Not
yet run end-to-end** — was blocked by the CUDA driver. After the driver works,
do a real smoke run (it needs `/data/paperwerk/vqa_20260524.parquet` and will
pull `Qwen/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct`).

Key API/design points (so you don't second-guess them):
- `import unsloth` MUST be first (it patches transformers/trl). noqa comments
  guard the import order against ruff/isort.
- `FastVisionModel.from_pretrained(MODEL_ID, load_in_4bit=False,
  use_gradient_checkpointing="unsloth", max_seq_length=4096)` — 16-bit LoRA to
  mirror the JAX bf16 base and give a clean vLLM-servable merged checkpoint.
- `FastVisionModel.get_peft_model(...)`: `finetune_vision_layers=False` (vision
  frozen, as in JAX), `target_modules=["q_proj","k_proj","gate_proj","up_proj",
  "down_proj"]`, r=16, alpha=32 — matches the JAX qwix LoRA exactly.
- `UnslothVisionDataCollator(model, processor, train_on_responses_only=True,
  instruction_part="<|im_start|>user\n", response_part="<|im_start|>assistant\n")`
  = the PyTorch equivalent of the JAX completion-only mask.
- **trl 0.24.0 specifics (verified against the resolved version):**
  `SFTTrainer(..., processing_class=processor, ...)` (NOT `tokenizer=`), and
  `SFTConfig(max_length=4096, ...)` (NOT `max_seq_length=`). Plus the vision
  trio: `remove_unused_columns=False`, `dataset_text_field=""`,
  `dataset_kwargs={"skip_prepare_dataset": True}`.
- Lazy `_VQADataset(torch.utils.data.Dataset)` decodes images per `__getitem__`
  (like the JAX `_DataLoader`) so all pages aren't held in RAM at once.
- Eval uses `model.generate` (greedy) + processor; F1/IoU + visualization helpers
  are copied verbatim from the JAX script (framework-agnostic).
- Save: `model.save_pretrained_merged(OUTPUT_DIR, processor,
  save_method="merged_16bit")` → loads directly in vLLM/transformers.
- Single-GPU (Unsloth uses GPU 0); the JAX version used a 2-GPU mesh.
- Hyperparams mirror JAX: 10k steps, peak LR 2e-4, 50 warmup, cosine, wd 0.01,
  grad-clip 1.0, eval/save every 500. (JAX cosine decayed to 1e-5; HF cosine
  decays to ~0 — close enough, noted in-code.)

Paths: `DATASET_PATH=/data/paperwerk/vqa_20260524.parquet`,
`OUTPUT_DIR=/data/models/vqa-20260529-qwen3vl-4b`,
`LORA_CKPT_DIR=/data/cache/vqa_20260529_lora_ckpts`,
tensorboard `/tmp/tensorboard/vqa_20260529_qwen3vl`.

